mixin winners-block()
  section.winners-block
    .container
      .winners-block__wrapper
        .winners-block__content
          h2.winners-block__title
            | Узнайте, кто уже победил

          a.winners-block__button.btn(href="winners.html")
            | Итоги розыгрыша

        picture.winners-block__visual
          source(
            media="(max-width: 767px)"
            srcset="img/content/prize-cup-mobile.png 1x, img/content/prize-cup-mobile@2x.png 2x"
          )
          img.winners-block__image(
            src="img/content/prize-cup-desktop.png"
            srcset="img/content/prize-cup-desktop@2x.png 2x"
            alt=""
          )